摘要:目的探讨金蝉止痒胶囊对小鼠皮肤瘙痒的治疗作用方法分别选用 2'4 二异氰酸甲苯酯右旋糖酐 4 －氨基吡啶引出小鼠瘙痒症状，给予金蝉止痒胶囊治疗，观察小鼠表现从而推断药物疗效结果金蝉止痒胶囊各剂量组均能够延长 2'4 －二异氰酸甲苯酯和 4 －氨基吡啶导致小鼠皮肤瘙痒的潜伏期( $\textstyle P < 0 . 0 5 )$ ，并明显减少 2'4 －二异氰酸甲苯酯导致的皮肤瘙痒过程中小鼠的搔抓次数( $P < 0 . 0 1 )$ ; 高剂量组金蝉止痒胶囊能够显著减少由右旋糖酐导致的小鼠皮肤瘙痒时间和小鼠单位时间内的搔抓次数( $\textstyle P < 0 . 0 5 )$ 。结论金蝉止痒胶囊可以有效抑制由多种原因导致的小鼠皮肤瘙痒症状，具有良好的止痒作用Research on Effect of Jinchan Relieving Itch Capsule on Mice Skin Itch 1 ， 3 ， 2 ， 3 ， 3 ， 3 ， 3 ， 3( 1． Hubei Provincial People  s Hospital，Wuhan，Hubei，China 430060; 2． Chengdu University of Traditional Chinese Medicine，Chengdu，Sichuan，China 611137; 3． Chongqing Healn Pharmaceutical Co． ，Ltd． ，Chongqing，China 401121)Abstract: Objective To explore the curative effect of Jinchan Relieving Itch Capsule on mice skin itch． Methods 2'4 toluene diisocyanate ( TDI) ，dextran( DX) and 4 － aminopyridine were selected for causing the skin itch symptom in mice respectively． The model mice were treated by Jinchan Relieving Itch Capsule and the mice manifestations were observed for deducing the curative effects of drugs． Results All doses groups of Jinchan Relieving Itch Capsule obviously prolonged the incubative stage of itch induced by TDI and 4 － aminopyridine( $P < 0 . 0 5 )$ and reduce the scratch times significantly during the itch process induced by TDI( $P < 0 . 0 1 )$ ; the high dose groups of Jinchan Relieving Itch Capsule could reduce the mice skin itch period and the scratch times induced by time induced by DX( ＜ 0． 05) ． Conclusion Jinchan Relieving Itch Capsule can effectively inhibit the skin itch symptom caused by various reasons and has well effect for relieving skin itch．Key word: Jinchan Relieving Itch Capsule; itch; alleviate itching皮肤瘙痒是一种常见的皮肤病，可由多种原因引起，瘙痒发作时令人难以忍受[1] 临床中多种疾病会出现使人难以忍受的痒感，如湿疹荨麻疹夏季皮炎等，会对患者的情绪产生严重影响，从而导致患者整体生理功能的紊乱金蝉止痒胶囊运用传统中医理论，以金银花栀子黄芩苦参黄柏龙胆白芷白鲜皮蛇床子蝉蜕连翘地肤子地黄青蒿广藿香甘草等中药组方，具有良好的清热解毒燥湿止痒作用。本研究中通过建立经典的痒觉动物模型，探讨金蝉止痒胶囊的止痒疗效，为临床应用提供基础的药理试验数据
